WEBVTT

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer

00:00:46.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Had a very shiny nose

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:25.000
And if you ever saw it

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:45.000
You would even say it glows

00:01:45.000 --> 00:02:10.000
All of the other reindeer used to laugh and call him names

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:30.000
They never let poor Rudolph join in any reindeer games

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:50.000
Then one foggy Christmas Eve, Santa came to say

00:02:50.000 --> 00:03:15.000
Rudolph, with your nose so bright, will you guide my sleigh tonight?

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:40.000
Then how the reindeer loved him, as they shouted out with glee

00:03:40.000 --> 00:04:05.000
Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer, you will go down in history!

00:04:05.000 --> 00:06:30.000
(Music and story)

00:06:30.000 --> 00:08:40.000
Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer!
